WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Give your agent an objective. Implement the repository-scoped read authorization described in README.md and publish a verified pull request.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Walk away. The agent discovers Decapod, claims its task and enters an isolated workspace.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:20.000
The check fails. Decapod rejects. Required authorization check failed. A member without a repository grant was allowed access.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:29.000
The agent investigates. Then repairs. The agent reads the failure and repairs repository-scoped access. No human supplies the fix.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:38.000
Come back to receipts. 10 access assertions. Independent source guard. Fresh execution, bound to the exact work.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:46.000
A real PR. Verified by Decapod. PR #7 · exact head and base independently read back on GitHub. Admission does not authorize merge.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:51.000
Change the work. Invalidate the proof. Separate operator probes changed source and advanced the target. Both rejected historical authorization.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Decapod Labs HARNESS AI METACOGNITION.

